                                "sense_id": "054e7f9c-6337-3fbd-8bff-6f254df8c1d7",
                                "text": "he would ſometimes break off in a ſudden and ſpirited Epiphonema, or rather Erotesis, raiſed a third, and ſometimes a full fifth, above the key of the diſcourſe, […]"
